Lyman Clark of said County being duly sworn says that he is well acquainted with Mary Phelps named in the foregoing application and has known her for ten or twelve years past, that he was acquainted with Silas Phelps, also in said application named, in his lifetime & for twenty years last past, that he knew the said Mary Phelps and the said Silas Phelps to live together as man and wife & to be so reputed for ten years preceding the death of said Silas Phelps, that said Silas died as stated in said declaration & that said declarant is the widow of said Silas Phelps who was a Revolutionary Pensioner as stated in said declaration. { Lyman Clark Subscribed & sworn before me

