Commonwealth of Massachusetts County of Norfolk S.S. on this tenth day of August in the year one thousand eight hundred before the Commonwealth. The foregoing was sworn to before me this and thirty eighth personally appeared Mahitoble Read a resident of Milton in said County aged seventy three years - who being first duly sworn according to Law doth on her oath make the following declaration in order to obtain the benefit of the provision made by the act of Congress passed July 7 th 1838 - entitled an act granting half pay and pensions to certain widows;
