The further declares that she was married to the said Jeremiah Fisher, at Northfield, in the State of Vermont, on the twenty ninth day of May, in the year eighteen hundred and five, by one Moses Morse, then a Justice of the Peace, and that her name before her said marriage, was Sabra Tubbs; and that she is still a widow, and was a widow at the time of the passage of said act, and that she has never before made an application for a pension, and has never been married since the death of her said husband; that she was not married

