Personally appeared Jacob Keener of石on County Tennessee before me the undersigned in Instruction of the Peace for said County who being duly sworn according to law declares that the facts set forth in the foregoing affidavit of Mrs Ribeccus Hemways are true as he acted as an attorney in her claim for Pensions and two others to wit Mrs Mary Rocks of Washington County and Mrs Margaret Carr formerly widow of William Brown of石on County Tennessee and also assistive in the claim of Mrs. Curtis widow of Boham Curtis all of whom draw 100 $/ per annum except Mrs Ribeccus Hemways who draw 80 $/ as she sets forth and that all of these husbands belonged to Armands Legion as the Pension Roll states.
