on this the 9th day of September 1844 personally appeared before me Hiram W Jones, a Justice of the peace in and for said County Rebecca Holloway a Resident citizen of Morgan County in the State of Tennessee and after being duly sworn for that purpose on her oath makes the following Decla- ration in order to obtain the Benefit of the act of Congress passed June the 17th 1844.
That she is the identical Rebecca Holloway who received a Pension under the act of Congress passed March the 3d 1844 at the rate of Forty dollars per annum, that she has not intermarried but continues the widow of John Holloway who was a deceased Revolutionary Pensioner under the act of Congress passed June 17th 1832 and Pensioned at the rate of forty dollars per annum, and is now dead
